<title>JAPAN: Komatsu - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		503.89		vs	  467.30</p>
<p> Pretax		18.19		vs	   11.13</p>
<p> Net		    6.04		vs	    4.98</p>
<p> EPS		    6.03 yen	  vs	    4.96 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Komatsu Ltd is a major construction machinery maker. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
